	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With careful aim, or a bit too much powder, it’s possible to punch through multiple targets. As an action, choose a line of fire from your square. This line has a length equal to the first range increment of the firearm you have readied. Make an attack roll. The first three creatures in that line become the targets of your attack, and you may compare your attack roll against their AC. On a successful hit, deal damage as normal.</p>",
